<title>NETHERLANDS: Akzo Nobel signs Chinese agreements.</title>
<headline>Akzo Nobel signs Chinese agreements.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemical group Akzo Nobel NV said on Wednesday its Organon Teknika unit had signed an agreement with China's Ministry of Health to work closely on health and medical technology research.</p>
<p>The Dutch company also announced it had signed an agreement to work with the Chinese government on environmental and safety issues in the chemical industry, with an emphasis on waste disposal.</p>
<p>Akzo Nobel said it would make an unspecified donation to the health ministry to fight hepatitis in China.</p>
